---
// Footer - ballaholic style: minimal
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer__inner">
    <div class="footer__top">
      <div class="footer__brand">
        <img width="1200" height="1200" decoding="async" src="/LOGO.webp" alt="Over Limit 本庄" class="footer__img-logo">
        <img width="424" height="104" decoding="async" src="/LOGO2.webp" alt="" class="footer__img-logo2">
      </div>
      <div class="footer__info">
        <p class="footer__nap">〒367-0042 埼玉県本庄市けや木1丁目1-16（JR本庄駅北口徒歩6分・無料駐車場完備）</p>
        <p class="footer__rep">代表：田代 セイイチ（黒帯3段） / TEL：<a href="tel:09065163248" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:underline;">090-6516-3248</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__links">
        <a href="/privacy/">プライバシーポリシー</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/304416070927536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer__bottom">
      <p class="footer__copy">&copy; Over Limit 本庄. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: #1A1A1A;
    padding: 42px 0 calc(28px + var(--test-cta-height, 0px));
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .footer__inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .footer__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 26px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .footer__brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer__img-logo,
  .footer__img-logo2 {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .footer__info {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .footer__nap, .footer__rep {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .footer__links a {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .footer__links a:hover {
    color: #FF6A00;
  }

  .footer__bottom {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer__copy {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer__top {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer__inner { padding: 0 20px; }
  }
</style>
